<section class="block keys" id="keys">
  <div>
    <h2>Without the mouse.</h2>
    <p class="lede">A hotkey opens the list of sessions from any app. <kbd>⌃⌥Y</kbd> allows the request on the card, <kbd>⌃⌥X</kbd> denies it.</p>
    <div class="try">
      <button type="button" class="keycaps" id="hotkey" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open the session list (Control Option N)">
        <kbd data-key="Control">⌃</kbd><kbd data-key="Alt">⌥</kbd><kbd data-key="KeyN">N</kbd>
      </button>
      <p class="fine">Opens the list. Press it right now, or tap the keys.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="modes">
    <h3>It interrupts as much as you let it</h3>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Loud</dt><dd>Expands and sounds for every request and every finished turn.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Smart</dt><dd>Only for a session that is not already in front of you.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Quiet</dt><dd>Counters only.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="fine">A Focus silences every mode.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .keys { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 56px; align-items: end; }
